{
    "title": "Feeld: Date & Meet New People",
    "description": "Feeld was made for you to connect with open-minded people looking to explore dating and relationships in a safe and private way. Chat & connect on an alternative dating app created for anyone and everyone. Feeld is open to anyone looking for an exciting, new type of dating experience.\r\n\r\nDiscover a space to be your true self and let the people looking for you find you. Join Feeld to explore virtual or other locations and connect with like-minded individuals worldwide. Connect openly in a diverse community open to all genders and sexual identities as you redefine your relationships to self and others on Feeld.\r\n\r\nDiscover an open-minded dating experience when you download today.\r\n\r\n\r\nFEELD FEATURES\r\n\r\nCHAT & CONNECT\r\n\u2022 Meet open-minded humans and start up a conversation\r\n\u2022 Connect with people closest to you, or explore 20+ of our most popular cities around the world\r\n\u2022 Find people looking to connect and discover a new way to date\r\n\r\nA DATING APP MADE FOR EVERYONE\r\n\u2022 Choose from over 20 gender identities\r\n\u2022 Pick from a list of 20+ sexualities to personalize your Feeld experience\r\n\r\nDATE YOUR WAY\r\n\u2022 Explore safely on a secure and private dating platform\r\n\u2022 Connect with curious Feeld members and explore your desires\r\n\u2022 Chat with open-minded Feeld members for meaningful, intimate experiences\r\n\r\nAs seen in: New York Times, The New Yorker, Dazed & Confused, Cosmopolitan and Vanity Fair.\r\n\r\nBecome Majestic for the full Feeld experience. With a Majestic membership, you can enjoy enhanced features such as seeing who liked you on the app, adding private photos visible only to your Connections, one free Ping a day, and more.\r\n\r\nDownload Feeld, a place to explore curiosity and desires, and date in a different way. Connect with other people around the world that are ready for a new, exciting way to date.\r\n\r\n\r\n______\r\n\r\nYou must be at least 18 years of age to access and use Feeld.\r\n\r\nThe app is free to download and use.\r\n\r\nAdditional features are available when you join the Majestic Membership, an optional paid subscription service that funds the app\u2019s development.\r\n\r\nSubscriptions must be managed by the members and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the Play Store Subscriptions screen after purchase. \r\n\r\nWhen a trial subscription is offered, the trial period begins when a member signs up for the subscription through their Play Store account. The subscription will be charged on the last day of the trial unless the member cancels at least 24 hours before trial ends.\r\n\r\nAny unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when the member purchases a subscription.\r\n\r\nTo cancel the Membership, members must cancel directly through their Play Store account.\r\n\r\nCancellations begin at the end of the current subscription period.\r\n\r\nAll purchases are billed to the payment method that you designate when you sign up for a Google Play account as part of your Play Store account and will appear as Google on your Play Store statement.\r\n\r\nAll personal data is handled under the Terms of Use of Feeld Privacy Policy. More details can be found here: https://feeld.co/about/privacy.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use can be found here: https://feeld.co/about/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Feeld was made for you to connect with open-minded people looking to explore dating and relationships in a safe and private way. Chat &amp; connect on an alternative dating app created for anyone and everyone. Feeld is open to anyone looking for an exciting, new type of dating experience.<br><br>Discover a space to be your true self and let the people looking for you find you. Join Feeld to explore virtual or other locations and connect with like-minded individuals worldwide. Connect openly in a diverse community open to all genders and sexual identities as you redefine your relationships to self and others on Feeld.<br><br>Discover an open-minded dating experience when you download today.<br><br><br>FEELD FEATURES<br><br>CHAT &amp; CONNECT<br>\u2022 Meet open-minded humans and start up a conversation<br>\u2022 Connect with people closest to you, or explore 20+ of our most popular cities around the world<br>\u2022 Find people looking to connect and discover a new way to date<br><br>A DATING APP MADE FOR EVERYONE<br>\u2022 Choose from over 20 gender identities<br>\u2022 Pick from a list of 20+ sexualities to personalize your Feeld experience<br><br>DATE YOUR WAY<br>\u2022 Explore safely on a secure and private dating platform<br>\u2022 Connect with curious Feeld members and explore your desires<br>\u2022 Chat with open-minded Feeld members for meaningful, intimate experiences<br><br>As seen in: New York Times, The New Yorker, Dazed &amp; Confused, Cosmopolitan and Vanity Fair.<br><br>Become Majestic for the full Feeld experience. With a Majestic membership, you can enjoy enhanced features such as seeing who liked you on the app, adding private photos visible only to your Connections, one free Ping a day, and more.<br><br>Download Feeld, a place to explore curiosity and desires, and date in a different way. Connect with other people around the world that are ready for a new, exciting way to date.<br><br><br>______<br><br>You must be at least 18 years of age to access and use Feeld.<br><br>The app is free to download and use.<br><br>Additional features are available when you join the Majestic Membership, an optional paid subscription service that funds the app\u2019s development.<br><br>Subscriptions must be managed by the members and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the Play Store Subscriptions screen after purchase. <br><br>When a trial subscription is offered, the trial period begins when a member signs up for the subscription through their Play Store account. The subscription will be charged on the last day of the trial unless the member cancels at least 24 hours before trial ends.<br><br>Any unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when the member purchases a subscription.<br><br>To cancel the Membership, members must cancel directly through their Play Store account.<br><br>Cancellations begin at the end of the current subscription period.<br><br>All purchases are billed to the payment method that you designate when you sign up for a Google Play account as part of your Play Store account and will appear as Google on your Play Store statement.<br><br>All personal data is handled under the Terms of Use of Feeld Privacy Policy. More details can be found here: https://feeld.co/about/privacy.<br><br>Terms of Use can be found here: https://feeld.co/about/terms",
